    <briefdescription>
<para>A regular raster grid of scalar observations. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Cell (row, col) carries a scalar value such as flood risk, temperature, or population density. Coordinates are WGS84 degrees.</para>
<para>Precision contract: lat/lon stored as double; round-trip via UTR must not lose &gt; 1e-7 degrees (checked by <computeroutput>fromGeospatial</computeroutput>). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
